# Caddy site block for the Whiteboard Review Hub on ltvera-staging. It lives in
# LTVera-Pandas deploy/Caddyfile.staging, served by that stack's caddy container;
# the hub container joins the ltvera-pandas_default network as `review-hub`
# (deploy/docker-compose.staging.yml).
#
# Cloudflare proxies the name to the VM in SSL mode "Full", which accepts
# Caddy's own CA. The hub enforces its own Basic Auth, so there is none here.

reviews-stg.ltvera.com {
	encode zstd gzip

	import edge_access_log

	reverse_proxy review-hub:8787
	tls internal
}
